{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9KYXBhbmVzZS1MYW5ndWFnZS9TYW11cmFpJTIwSUlJJTIwRHVlbCUyMGF0JTIwR2Fucnl1JTIwSXNsYW5kJTIwJTI4MTk1NiUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Samurai III Duel at Ganryu Island","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/oVGMAef2EGjeXc4rJTTqTJq1ib4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sL1Jv69vMefWm0BeowsETS07ALm.jpg","description":"A humble and simple Takezo abandons his life as a knight errant. He's sought as a teacher and vassal by Shogun, Japan's most powerful clan leader. He's also challenged to fight by the supremely confident and skillful Sasaki Kojiro. Takezo agrees to fight Kojiro in a year's time but rejects Shogun's patronage, choosing instead to live on the edge of a village, raising vegetables. He's followed there by Otsu and later by Akemi, both in love with him. The year ends as Takezo assists the villagers against a band of brigands. He seeks Otsu's forgiveness and accepts her love, then sets off across the water to Ganryu Island for his final contest.\n\nReleased 3 Jan 1956 · Japan · Language: Japanese · 105 min\nStudio: TOHO\n\nOn your server — Audio: Japanese","releaseInfo":"1956","genres":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Romance","Others"],"imdbRating":"7.2","imdb_id":"tt0049710","moviedb_id":31378,"tmdbId":31378,"runtime":"105 min","cast":["Toshirō Mifune","Koji Tsuruta","Kaoru Yachigusa","Mariko Okada","Kuroemon Onoe II","Michiko Saga","Takashi Shimura","Minoru Chiaki"],"director":["Hiroshi Inagaki"],"writer":["Hiroshi Inagaki","Eiji Yoshikawa","Tokuhei Wakao"],"released":"1956-01-03T00:00:00.000Z","country":"Japan","language":"Japanese","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Hiroshi Inagaki","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1w8ZE9L7db2Io1sJ3soAlPSw6Wc.jpg"},{"name":"Toshirō Mifune","character":"Musashi Miyamoto a.k.a. Takezo","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cZ5ybA7cDA0EBMaM5jX2f7RNBVb.jpg"},{"name":"Koji Tsuruta","character":"Kojiro